# === Produktion (Cloudflare D1) ===
# 1. Erstelle D1 DB: npx wrangler d1 create ticket-pilot-db
# 2. Kopiere die Database ID in wrangler.toml
# 3. Erstelle Schema: npx wrangler d1 execute ticket-pilot-db --file=./schema.sql
# 4. Setze TURSO_DATABASE_URL und TURSO_AUTH_TOKEN in Vercel/Hosting

# === Vercel Environment Variables ===
# NEXTAUTH_URL=https://deine-domain.vercel.app
# NEXTAUTH_SECRET=dein-geheimer-key
# TURSO_DATABASE_URL=libsql://...
# TURSO_AUTH_TOKEN=...
# RESEND_API_KEY=re_...
# EMAIL_FROM=...
# ABLY_API_KEY=...
